# ── ArienX — local state that never belongs in the repository ─────────────────
# Everything listed here is created by the app on first run. A fresh clone with
# none of it present boots straight to the setup screen, which is the intended
# first experience — so nothing here needs to be committed, and some of it must
# never be.

# ── Secrets. Committing any of these publishes them. ──────────────────────────
# Gemini API keys and per-plugin credentials
config/api_keys.json
# Dashboard TLS material
config/certs/
# Linked WhatsApp session data
config/whatsapp_web/
# Google OAuth tokens and client secrets
**/token*.json
**/client_secret*.json
*credentials*.json
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*

# ── Personal data the assistant accumulates about you ─────────────────────────
memory/long_term.json
memory/chats.json
memory/personality_profiles.json
memory/cloud_safe.json
memory/*.db

# Private certificates, bridge credentials, and exported secret material
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx

# ── Python build noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# ── Virtual environments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ── Editors and operating systems ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Runtime output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
downloads/
screenshots/

# ── Local backups. Never commit these (may sit next to live config). ──────
*.bak
*.tmp
